@appointment midnight-feast
// SW2, 0.92.6 item 9 (the user: yes). Midnight feast: you book a late snack in your bunk room with two or more of your
// bunkmates (a group appointment), after 22:00 on a night before a day off. Someone brings the grab shelf's best,
// someone tells a story, someone falls asleep first. Written for Bunk 1, your bunk: Tomas, Chloe Tran ("Lights out."
// at ten, disapproves of gossip, then asks how it ends), Zofia Santos (stall patter, public gossip only), Lukas
// Dlamini (up early, so he falls asleep first; says a number: days to home). Lines from anyone absent are skipped.
// The scene plays like an overheard chat, then one choice for you.
title: Midnight feast
starts: ask
host: you
gate: two or more bunkmates free, the night before your day off
when: after 22:00
at: 22:00-22:45
where: 4 pool bunk
who: you, your bunkmates (2-4)
once: no
mem: appt.feast
record: Had a midnight feast with Bunk 1.

== ask
- Midnight feast in the bunk room?
- Yes! I'll raid the grab shelf. Don't tell Pell. He'll want in.   #funny
- Only if I'm in bed by midnight. Fine. I'm bringing biscuits.

== busy
- Not tonight. I'm on early. Next time, I promise.

== mail
- Tonight, {time}: a midnight feast in the bunk room. Bring something from the grab shelf. Whisper.

== scene
santos-zofia: Right. I've got the grab shelf's last two plates, and I didn't even have to trade for them.   [laugh]
tran-chloe: It's after ten. It's lights out. ...Pass me a plate.   [laugh]
tomas: Can we tell stories? Like at camp? We never had camp. Like I imagine camp.
dlamini-lukas: Ninety-one.   [nod]
santos-zofia: He means days to home. He says it to the ceiling every night.
tran-chloe: Zofia, tell the one about your stall back home. Not the gossip one. Fine, the gossip one.   [laugh]
dlamini-lukas: Mm. Not asleep. ...Mm.   [sigh]
tomas: He's asleep. He's always first. He says it's the early team. It's not.   [laugh]
? choice
* Tell a story of your own.   flavour:share mem:appt.feast
  tomas: That was a good one! Do another. Quietly. Lukas is snoring.   [laugh]
* Quietly take the last biscuit.   flavour:cheer mem:appt.feast
  santos-zofia: Bold move. I'd have traded you something for that.   [laugh]
* Just listen to everyone.   flavour:listen mem:appt.feast
  tran-chloe: You're the only one in this bunk who listens. Don't change.   [nod]
tran-chloe: Right. Now it's lights out. Actually. Good night, Bunk 1.

== thanks
- A midnight feast in the bunk room: the grab shelf's best, a story or two, and Lukas asleep first, as always.   #warm

== after
- Best midnight feast yet. Lukas didn't even make it to the biscuits.   #funny
- Chloe said "lights out" four times last night. She stayed up latest.   #funny
